; What a dead monster leaves on the floor.
;
; Not a creature so much as a thing lying there, and the absences say so:
;
;   - no Body, so no weapon will ever shoot at it
;   - no Geometry, so it does not shoulder anything aside or block a corridor
;   - no CAN_ATTACK and nothing to attack with
;
; STRUCTURE is what makes the client draw it as a box on the floor rather than as
; a creature, and gives it a bigger dot on the minimap -- which is the point of a
; chest, since walking over to one is the decision it asks for.
Object
  Name = Chest
  DisplayName = Chest
  KindOf = [STRUCTURE]
  VisionRange = 0
  LootUpdate
  End
End
